WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Time tracking. Run a timer on a task or add time by hand, and see everyone's entries.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: client billing; estimate check.

3
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:11.930
Start a timer on the task…

4
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:14.890
…and it shows in the header wherever you go.

5
00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:16.630
Stop it from the header.

6
00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:21.670
Or add time by hand…

7
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:25.730
Everyone's entries add up to the task's total.

8
00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:31.730
Add time is disabled: The text isn't a time Flow understands — try “45m” or “1:30”.

9
00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:36.230
Start/stop timer
